{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "work_monologue_001",
      "revision": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "title": "下班後的心聲",
      "trigger": {
        "action": "work",
        "timing": "after_settlement"
      },
      "conditions": {
        "minimumDay": 1,
        "maximumDay": null,
        "minimumMoney": 0,
        "maximumMoney": null,
        "timePeriods": [],
        "requiredCompletedEventIDs": [],
        "requiredFlags": [],
        "excludedFlags": []
      },
      "selectionWeight": 1,
      "background": {
        "mode": "inherit"
      },
      "participants": [
        "player"
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerID": "player",
          "text": "今天總算忙完了。雖然站得有點累，但離買車又近了一點。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerID": "player",
          "text": "先把這筆錢存好，接下來要做什麼呢？",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "work_boss_chat_001",
      "revision": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "title": "店長的叮嚀",
      "trigger": {
        "action": "work",
        "timing": "after_settlement"
      },
      "conditions": {
        "minimumDay": 1,
        "maximumDay": null,
        "minimumMoney": 0,
        "maximumMoney": null,
        "timePeriods": [],
        "requiredCompletedEventIDs": [],
        "requiredFlags": [],
        "excludedFlags": []
      },
      "selectionWeight": 1,
      "background": {
        "mode": "inherit"
      },
      "participants": [
        "boss",
        "player"
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerID": "boss",
          "text": "{playerName}，今天辛苦了。剛才尖峰時段，你處理得還不錯。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerID": "player",
          "text": "謝謝店長，我還在熟悉收銀機，有時候會慢一點。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_003",
          "speakerID": "boss",
          "text": "慢慢來，把帳算對比較重要。路上小心，明天見。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "work_handover_001",
      "revision": 1,
      "enabled": true,
      "title": "交班前的小插曲",
      "trigger": {
        "action": "work",
        "timing": "after_settlement"
      },
      "conditions": {
        "minimumDay": 1,
        "maximumDay": null,
        "minimumMoney": 0,
        "maximumMoney": null,
        "timePeriods": [],
        "requiredCompletedEventIDs": [],
        "requiredFlags": [],
        "excludedFlags": []
      },
      "selectionWeight": 1,
      "background": {
        "mode": "inherit"
      },
      "participants": [
        "boss",
        "player",
        "coworker"
      ],
      "dialogues": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerID": "boss",
          "text": "你們先等一下，今天的交班有件事要提醒。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "coworker",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerID": "coworker",
          "text": "是冰箱裡那批新到的飲料嗎？我已經補好了。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "coworker",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_003",
          "speakerID": "player",
          "text": "我也把庫存數量記下來了，清單放在櫃檯旁邊。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "coworker",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "line_004",
          "speakerID": "boss",
          "text": "很好，有互相幫忙就順多了。今天辛苦了，早點回去休息。",
          "stage": [
            {
              "characterID": "boss",
              "slot": "left"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "player",
              "slot": "center"
            },
            {
              "characterID": "coworker",
              "slot": "right"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
